  --- the verdict ---
  A LESSON SILENT ABOUT A's AXIS IS FREE, AT POWER. +11.5 SE over a lesson
  that demands A's axis, with A itself coming out of the gap no worse than
  it went in (1.024). Two families said this and could not prove it; this
  one had the seeds to.
  THE ACCOUNT CLOSES: `retain`'s wipe and `capacity`'s coexistence are one
  mechanism at two angles, and whether a second lesson costs the first is a
  property of WHAT IT ASKS. The limit belongs in the same sentence: one
  formant has one axis, so this buys coexistence ACROSS articulators and
  never within one.
