  one no prototype rule can find however cleanly the classes separate.

  --- the reading ---
  THE FEATURE IS SEPARABLE. The ear's rate_ema does distinguish the words at
  the moment the index is read, so source 4 is not the wrong source and the
  0.012 separation credgate measured is the CLASSIFIER failing to extract
  what is there.
  AND THE FITTING RULE IS THE TARGET, not the sampling gate -- gate 1 was
  refused, gate 2 (DeSieno's conscience) takes a-vs-i from 0.002 to 0.999
  under a shuffled order, gate 3 (seeding from data) adds nothing and gate 4
  (seeding without the conscience) is inert to the bit. What remains
  unexplained is WHICH pairs it works on: a-i 0.999, a-u ~0.5, i-u 0.000.
