    F1   +0.976   against a bin-shuffled null of -0.126
    F2   +0.946   against a bin-shuffled null of -0.003

  is the shape AUDIBLE? start of an utterance against its end:
    d' 0.195 against a shuffled null of -0.006
  (teaching moves F1 by ~70 Hz for comparison; a shared shape can be
